IPv6 Subnetting:
Design the Accenture Network using fafa:cafe:fafa:fefe::/64 to 50 offices. 
each digit is equivalent to /4.

RIVAN Method CAI
C- convert 50 offices
A- /64 + /6 (6 bits) = /70
I- IChambaMoPattern: or Ipasok (Hextet, HexDigit, increment)

/70 = (5th Hextet, 2nd Hexdigit, 4i)

1st Office: fafa:cafe:fafa:fefe::/70
2nd Office: fafa:cafe:fafa:fefe:0400::/70
3rd Office: fafa:cafe:fafa:fefe:0800::/70
4th Office: fafa:cafe:fafa:fefe:0c00::/70 
5th Office: fafa:cafe:fafa:fefe:1000::/70 
6th Office: fafa:cafe:fafa:fefe:1400::/70 
7th Office: fafa:cafe:fafa:fefe:1800::/70
8th Office: fafa:cafe:fafa:fefe:1c00::/70 

IMPLEMENT:
conf t
ipv6 unicast-routing
int lo101
ipv6 add fafa:cafe:fafa:fefe::1/70
int lo102
ipv6 add fafa:cafe:fafa:fefe:0400::1/70
int lo103
ipv6 add fafa:cafe:fafa:fefe:0800::1/70
int lo104
ipv6 add fafa:cafe:fafa:fefe:0c00::1/70
end

