HSRP - Hot Standby Routing Protocol
we use virtual IP for the end host's gateway address instead of the router's ip address. 

@Coretaas 
conf t
hostname coretaasPLDT
track 1 int g0/1 line-protocol
int vlan 1
standby 1 ip 10.71.1.6
standby 1 preempt 
standby 1 priority 150
standby 1 track 1 decrement 60
end

